------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope & provenance
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Individual lab procedures, reagent quantities, temperatures, and times are
facts and methods that are not subject to copyright. This license therefore
applies to Bioinfospace's compilation and expression (the selection,
arrangement, and wording), not to any underlying third-party work.

Protocols are adapted and restated from external sources — see the "Recipes
sourced from" list in the README — including protocols.io community protocols,
academic journals (Nature Protocols/Methods, STAR Protocols, CSHL), reference
texts, and manufacturer technical manuals. Where an individual source protocol
carries its own license (for example, a specific Creative Commons license on
protocols.io), that license and its attribution requirements govern that entry
and are not overridden by this file.


